OL,3,GNEWSABute House protested by
OL,4,Aenvironmental campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FEnvironmental campaigners have staged a
OL,7,FHalloween themed demonstration outside
OL,8,Fthe first minister's official residence
OL,9,Fover "scary" fossil fuels.
OL,11,FClimate groups gathered outside Bute
OL,12,FHouse in Edinburgh to protest against
OL,13,Fthe Scottish government's decision to
OL,14,Fgive the go-ahead for a new, gas-fired,
OL,15,Fpower station at Peterhead in
OL,16,FAberdeenshire.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
