OL,3,GNEWSABute House protested by
OL,4,Aenvironmental campaigners
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision has been branded a
OL,7,F"catastrophic failure" by environmental
OL,8,Fcampaigners, who said burning fossil
OL,9,Ffuels is the key driver of extreme
OL,10,Fweather such as recent storms, record
OL,11,Fheat and flooding.
OL,13,FThe Scottish government said it
OL,14,Fremained committed to tackling climate
OL,15,Fchange.
